---
import ApplicationLayout from '../layouts/ApplicationLayout.astro';

const articleJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "Our Reconditioning Standard | Dolphin Centrifuge",
  "description": "Exactly what every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge from Dolphin receives - inspection, OEM-spec parts, dynamic balancing, a full test run, and a documented test report shipped with every unit.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Sanjay Prabhu MSME",
    "jobTitle": "Centrifuge Applications Engineer",
    "worksFor": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge",
      "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com"
    },
    "description": "40+ years of specialized experience in industrial centrifuge systems",
    "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/about-dolphin-centrifuge/",
    "alumniOf": {
      "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity",
      "name": "University of Arkansas",
      "location": "Fayetteville, AR, US"
    },
    "hasCredential": {
      "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential",
      "name": "Master of Science in Mechanical Engineering",
      "credentialCategory": "Master's degree",
      "recognizedBy": {
        "@type": "CollegeOrUniversity",
        "name": "University of Arkansas",
        "location": "Fayetteville, AR, US"
      },
      "description": "Master of Science in Mechanical Engineering, University of Arkansas, Fayetteville, Class of 1990"
    }
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Dolphin Centrifuge",
    "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com"
  },
  "url": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/",
  "mainEntityOfPage": "https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/"
};

const toc = [
  { id: "standard", label: "What Every Remanufactured Unit Receives" },
  { id: "test-report", label: "Why the Test Report Matters" },
  { id: "warranty", label: "Warranty & Support" },
];
---

<ApplicationLayout
  hideBottomCTA={true}
  title="Our Reconditioning Standard | Dolphin Centrifuge"
  pageTitle="Our Reconditioning Standard"
  description="Exactly what every remanufactured Alfa Laval centrifuge from Dolphin receives - inspection, OEM-spec parts, dynamic balancing, a full test run, and a documented test report shipped with every unit."
  canonicalUrl="https://dolphincentrifuge.com/centrifuge-reconditioning-standard/"
  category="services"
  categoryLabel="Services"
  toc={toc}
  relatedProducts={[
    { label: "Alfa Laval Centrifuges", href: "/alfa-laval-centrifuges/" },
    { label: "Disc Stack Centrifuge", href: "/disc-stack-centrifuge/" },
  ]}
  relatedApplications={[
    { label: "Industrial Disc Centrifuge Repair", href: "/industrial-disc-centrifuge-repair/" },
    { label: "Industrial Centrifuge Sample Testing", href: "/industrial-centrifuge-sample-testing/" },
  ]}
  jsonLd={[articleJsonLd]}
>

  <p>
    A reconditioned centrifuge is only as good as the shop that rebuilds it. Here is exactly what every remanufactured centrifuge from Dolphin receives - so you know what you are buying, and why these machines run reliably for decades.
  </p>

  <h2 id="standard">What Every Remanufactured Unit Receives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Bowl and critical rotating components inspected and NDT (non-destructive) checked</li>
    <li>Worn parts replaced with OEM-spec components</li>
    <li>Rotating assembly dynamically balanced to specification</li>
    <li>A full test run at rated speed before shipment</li>
    <li>A documented test report shipped with every unit - your proof it ran right before it left our floor</li>
    <li>Backed by our 6-month mechanical warranty, plus ongoing technical support, available to the original purchaser, for the life of the machine</li>
  </ul>

  <p><em>This describes our general reconditioning standard. It is not a binding specification - actual scope varies by unit condition and is defined in your quote.</em></p>

  <h2 id="test-report">Why the Test Report Matters</h2>
  <p>
    Most sellers ask you to take their word for it. We ship a documented test report with every remanufactured centrifuge - the same data our own engineers sign off on before a machine leaves the floor. You see exactly how your unit performed on our test stand, so a remanufactured centrifuge from Dolphin is a documented, verified machine - not an unknown.
  </p>

  <h2 id="warranty">Warranty &amp; Support</h2>
  <p>
    Our remanufactured centrifuges carry a 6-month mechanical warranty covering defects in parts, materials, and workmanship from the date of delivery, as specified in your formal proposal, plus ongoing technical support available to the original purchaser for the life of the machine. Standard exclusions apply (wear and consumable items such as seals, gaskets, friction material, and bearings). Full warranty terms and conditions are provided in the Warranty &amp; Terms document that accompanies every proposal and governs each sale.
    Call (248) 522-2573 or email sales@dolphincentrifuge.com with any questions.
  </p>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-gold/10 border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-xl p-5 my-8 not-prose">
    <p class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Talk to an Engineer</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-light mb-3">Ready to see what a documented, verified remanufactured centrifuge looks like? Request a quote and an engineer will follow up.</p>
    <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/" class="inline-block bg-gold text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-gold/90 transition-colors text-sm">Request a Quote</a>
  </div>

</ApplicationLayout>
